### 登录，拿到 token 后自动填进下面的 {{token}}
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "owner",
  "password": "youkong123"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 校验当前 token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 店铺信息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shops/1

### 员工列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shops/1/staff

### 服务项目
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shops/1/services

### 查明天 小鹿 做「基础单色(30min)」的可用时间
GET http://localhost:8080/api/availability?staffId=1&serviceId=1&date=2026-11-17

### 查明天 小鹿 做「法式延长(90min)」的可用时间
GET http://localhost:8080/api/availability?staffId=1&serviceId=2&date=2026-11-17

### 创建预约
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "staffId": 1,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "startAt": "2026-11-17T10:00:00",
  "customerName": "王女士",
  "customerPhone": "13800138000"
}

### 确认预约（把 id 换成上一步返回的）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/confirm

### 改期
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/reschedule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startAt": "2026-11-17T15:00:00"
}

### 取消预约（会释放档期）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/cancel

### 完成核销
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/complete

### 某人某天的预约列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings?staffId=1&date=2026-11-17

### 按手机号查我的预约
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/mine?phone=13800138000

### 店主：某天全部预约
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/shops/1/bookings?date=2026-11-17
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 店主：服务列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/shops/1/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 店主：新增服务
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/shops/1/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "睫毛加密",
  "durationMinutes": 90,
  "priceCent": 21800
}

### 店主：编辑服务
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/services/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "睫毛加密",
  "durationMinutes": 75,
  "priceCent": 19800
}

### 店主：删除服务（有预约记录时返回 3003）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/services/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 店主：员工列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/shops/1/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 店主：新增员工
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/shops/1/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "阿棠",
  "title": "美睫师",
  "active": true
}

### 店主：查询排班
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/staff/1/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 店主：覆盖周排班（不传的星期视为休息）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/staff/1/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "dayOfWeek": 1, "startTime": "10:00", "endTime": "20:00" },
  { "dayOfWeek": 3, "startTime": "10:00", "endTime": "20:00" }
]
